            'content_html' => '<h1>Turnkey Paper Machine Production Line</h1><p class="product-description">Our Turnkey Paper Machine Production Lines provide complete end-to-end engineering from the approach flow system to the final pope reel. Tailored for production capacities up to 1,200 TPD and speeds up to 1,200 m/min, each line is engineered to produce high-grade Kraft linerboard, corrugating medium, duplex board, and printing/writing paper with optimal energy consumption and superior sheet quality.</p><h2>Integrated Machine Sections & Architecture</h2><ul><li><strong>Hydraulic / Pressurized Headbox:</strong> Features micro-turbulence step-diffuser generator blocks, integrated pulsation dampening chamber, and CD dilution profiling system to guarantee uniform basis weight (GSM variation ±1.5%) and fiber orientation across deckles up to 8,000 mm.</li><li><strong>Forming Section (Wire):</strong> Single Fourdrinier, Multi-Fourdrinier, or Top-Wire Former configurations equipped with solid alumina ceramic dewatering elements, adjustable foil boxes, suction boxes, and high-vacuum suction couch rolls.</li><li><strong>Press Section:</strong> High-impact dewatering arrangements including Bi-Nip, Tri-Nip, or Wide-Nip Shoe Press (Maxi-Press™) technology delivering dry sheet output of 45%–50% prior to entering the dryer section.</li><li><strong>Dryer Section:</strong> Heavy-duty HT300 cast iron dryer cylinders (1500 mm / 1800 mm diameter) operating up to 8 bar steam pressure, equipped with enclosed hoods, pocket ventilation, silent gear drives, and multi-stage steam cascade systems.</li><li><strong>Size Press & Calender:</strong> Surface sizing unit and hard/soft-nip calender stacks engineered for precise starch pickup, controlled sheet thickness, smoothness, and printability.</li><li><strong>Pope Reel Winder:</strong> Automatic spool-change pope reel with pneumatic/hydraulic primary and secondary winding arms, web tension feedback, and automatic reel change at full production speed.</li></ul><h2>Key Features and Benefits</h2><ul><li><strong>Complete Turnkey Solutions:</strong> Single-source engineering, manufacturing, installation, and commissioning support from headbox to pope reel.</li><li><strong>Advanced CD Dilution Control:</strong> Precision headbox stock distribution delivering exceptional cross-direction GSM uniformity.</li><li><strong>Energy-Saving Shoe Pressing:</strong> High dewatering shoe press technology boosts sheet dryness entering the dryer, lowering steam energy consumption by up to 20%.</li><li><strong>Robust Heavy Framing:</strong> Vibration-free structural steel framing clad in SS-304 stainless steel in all wet-end areas for long operational life.</li><li><strong>Optimized Dryer Ventilation:</strong> Enclosed dryer hood and multi-stage condensate cascade system for uniform moisture profile and zero sheet fluttering.</li><li><strong>Integrated Automation Interface:</strong> Fully integrated with DCS and Quality Control Systems (QCS) for real-time monitoring of machine speed, GSM, moisture, and caliper.</li></ul><h2>Applications</h2><ul><li>Kraft Linerboard, Testliner, and Corrugating Fluting Medium packaging papers.</li><li>Duplex Board, Triplex Board, and Folding Boxboard (FBB) multi-ply board mills.</li><li>High-grade Writing, Printing, Offset, and Copier paper production.</li><li>Specialty technical paper grades and heavy linerboard manufacturing.</li></ul><h2>Materials of Construction</h2><ul><li><strong>Headbox Interior:</strong> Solid SS-316L stainless steel with mirror-polished slurry flow channels.</li><li><strong>Forming Dewatering Elements:</strong> Solid High-Purity Alumina Ceramic / ZrO2 ceramic tops on SS-304 sub-structures.</li><li><strong>Dryer Cylinders:</strong> HT250 / HT300 Alloy Cast Iron certified to ASME and CE pressure vessel standards.</li><li><strong>Structural Framing:</strong> Heavy structural steel framing protected by SS-304 stainless cladding in wet sections and multi-layer epoxy coating.</li></ul><h2>Technical Specifications</h2><ul><li>Daily Production Capacity: 50 TPD to 1,200 TPD</li><li>Design Machine Speed: 150 m/min to 1,200 m/min</li><li>Wire Deckle Width: 2,000 mm to 8,000 mm</li><li>Paper Basis Weight (GSM) Range: 40 GSM to 450+ GSM</li><li>Max Dryer Steam Pressure: 3.5 bar to 8.0 bar</li><li>Finished Paper Reel Diameter: Up to 2,800 mm</li></ul>',
